            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pecheleleaw"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Never thought of this- as a twist on regular Deggs..I think I solved the dryness of it though-instead of using mayo and mix, I add 'Litehouse' ranch dressing. Wow, that's good (it's versatile too) add some chopped green onion and a few bacon pieces. The possibilities are endless. Thanks for another way of looking at an old favorite!",
            "datePublished": "2010-03-15T22:01:00.423Z"
